@regression @transfers @REQ-TRF-1 @smoke @fees
Scenario: Happy path transfer charges the fee and credits the receiver # features/transfers.feature:6
  Given an account "alice" with balance "100.00"                       # bank.api.steps.AccountSteps.anAccountWithBalance(java.lang.String,java.lang.String)
  And an account "bob" with balance "0.00"                             # bank.api.steps.AccountSteps.anAccountWithBalance(java.lang.String,java.lang.String)
  When I transfer "10.10" from "alice" to "bob"                        # bank.api.steps.TransferSteps.iTransfer(java.lang.String,java.lang.String,java.lang.String)
